<title>FRANCE: GAN to show H1 loss of 950 mln Ffr - paper.</title>
<headline>GAN to show H1 loss of 950 mln Ffr - paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>French newspaper Les Echos said on Wednesday French insurer GAN would announce a half year loss of around 950 million francs later in the day.</p>
<p>It said the loss would be mainly due to problems involving its property banking unit UIC which lost 758 million francs in the first half as well as a new fall in real estate prices.</p>
<p>The newspaper La Tribune predicted a loss of nearly one billion francs by GAN.  </p>
<p>GAN made a loss of 387 million francs in the first half of 1995.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
